  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5c364ea64bdf614b9dda1453a961805, type: 3}
  m_Name: Week2_Mission1_Dialogue_1 V1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Jonas
  speechLines:
  - The first thing I should do is to choose an empty tile using the D-Pad, then
    select it using the Y button.
  - 'Next, I should choose a number using the D-Pad, then select it using the Y button.

'
  - Then, the empty tile will be filled with the selected number!
  - "I think if I put a number on a space that already has a number, it\u2019d be
    wrong."
  - "It\u2019d be wrong as well to have the same number on a row, column, or grid!"
  - If I get any of it wrong, I could restart using the A button.
